      ],
      "say": "Hi, I'm Hawser! Modular just published the whole Mojo and MAX stack. Here is how it works."
    },
    {
      "type": "idea",
      "text": "The graph compiler, the runtime and the hardware plugins are now source you can read and patch, under a licence that allows binaries but not public forks.",
